rows.en:
The club room door shut...
My body crumpled to the floor.
After that, nothing moved ever again..........{p}

Oh, what the heck, I'll go.
He's really eccentric, but...
he seems to know lots of unusual stories.{p}

"Right. On the land where they're building the second gym, there used to be an old school building.
It was torn down two summers ago.
The old school building was a place with tons of supernatural phenomena..."{p}

"Look, there's this one, too."
"Ahaha.
That's hilarious."{p}

Well, time for me to go into the club room.
I wonder if {a}'s mad at me...
First things first, a knock...{p}

Knock knock.
"Sorry I'm late!
It's Taguchi, the first-year!"{p}

"So you are the seventh one after all.
Honestly, Hino has such a nasty streak.
He even set up a prank like this."{p}

Geez... what do I have to say to make them believe me?
Hmm, something from my time that doesn't exist here...
...I've got it!☆{p}

I smiled back, not to be outdone.
A devil's smile.
The two of us drained our glasses in one gulp.{p}
